## What we collect

When you send a form, we receive what you type in it (such as your name, email, phone and coin details). The forms are handled by our website host, Netlify.

## How we use it

Only to reply to you and to handle your submission. We do not sell your information.

## Lookups

When you use the PCGS lookup, the number you type is sent to PCGS to fetch the result. Your IP address is used briefly to stop abuse of the tool.

## Contact

Questions about your information: see the [Contact page](/contact). [PLACEHOLDER — Alex to confirm]
